    "label": "8",
    "prompt": "The average of two numbers is twice the smaller number. The larger number is 12. What is the smaller number?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "4",
      "worked": "Let $x$ be the smaller number.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x+12}{2}&=2x\\\\x+12&=4x\\\\12&=3x\\\\x&=4\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe smaller number is 4.",
